WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:07.000
Where do you live now - and will you return to Kfar Aza?

00:08.466 --> 00:11.366
I'm living now in the Kibbutz Ruhama,

00:11.366 --> 00:15.300
20 km from here in a caravan.

00:15.300 --> 00:21.300
Temporary house, and waiting to get back.

00:21.866 --> 00:24.866
We want to get back, but it will take

00:26.066 --> 00:27.733
a year or something.
